00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5733148,"review":"Everything was amazing really room is very clean and very comfortable,, includes everything needed \nStuff are really supportive and anytime you need them they’ll show up fast\nIt was the first time there and won’t be the last.\nThanks for everything 🌺","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5738909,"review":"The place was very clean and exactly like the pictures. The compound is still new, so the road to it isn’t the best. It’s about 9–10 minutes from downtown and 14 minutes from the marina, so having a car is highly recommended, especially in summer. The pool is great but could use a bit more cleaning, especially at night. The team was very responsive, and although there was a small issue during check-in due to the QR code, they solved it in less than 10 minutes at the gate. Overall, the stay was excellent value for money","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5744256,"review":"We had a good time there.","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5750339,"review":"Amazing place, communication with the host was perfect, they helped a lot. Would definitely stay there again and highly recommend to everyone.","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5755237,"review":"Very clean very nice. Ideal for 2. And nice company they always check in how is it going or you need something. Very happy","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5773637,"review":"The place was so nice, cozy and clean and the check-in was super smooth, would definitely go back soon !","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5784173,"review":"The team behind the host is super friendly and super fast in responding actually a very nice experience overall","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5797080,"review":"It was my first and definitely not the last :') We enjoyed our stay, the place looked exactly like the photos,The view is spectacular. \nAlso the host \" Xuru\" was quite keen to help us :) \nThank you for being responsive and being open for any requests ♥️\nThank you for giving us a great experience.","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5799380,"review":"Nice and quiet place to stay!","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5803394,"review":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ 5/5\nI had a wonderful stay! The place was exactly as described—clean, comfortable, and well-located. Xuru Stays was very responsive, friendly, and made check-in/check-out super easy. I would definitely stay here again and highly recommend it to anyone visiting the area.","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z"},{"id":5817473,"review":"Parfait","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5847669,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5852214,"review":"Great stay.","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5861666,"review":"Super Unterkunft, ich kann sie definitiv empfehlen.\nKommunikation war sehr freundlich und hilfreich. \nIch komme gerne wieder.","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5868357,"review":"it was just a delightful stay, they were very responsive. i had couple of tiny issues that they were on top of it\nthe only issue is that the place wasnt next to anything, pretty desserted. but everything else was just great. thank you for the great stay.","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z"},{"id":5892611,"review":"Great","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5919319,"review":"Très bien bonne expérience. Hôte très réactif. Je recommande !","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5923512,"review":"The apartment was in a good location and view as well and had a comfortable stay there.","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":6023945,"review":"My stay in El Gouna was honestly exactly what I needed. So peaceful, so beautiful, and just the perfect little escape. I felt so comfortable and relaxed the whole time. Can’t wait to come back again 🤍.","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6086783,"review":"Room was very clean. Customer service were very helpful with our queries.","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:23.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:23.000000Z"},{"id":6099278,"review":"I really enjoyed my time here, many thanks to the host ❤️","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6101627,"review":"my stay was very calming , the apartment had all the  amenities u need and dont need tbh, it was easy checking in and checking out host was available anytime , recommend this place for a small family.","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6123411,"review":".","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6128092,"review":"N/A","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6157404,"review":"The place is nice & cozy & perfect space for a couple. Wish the host told us the elevator wasn’t working before arriving. Other than that was a good stay","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6171003,"review":"The host was very responsive but the location is a bit far away from downtown, you need a car to get around, and you need to get your own bedsheets and towels as they weren’t in the best condition. Overall we had a great time and we might consider staying there again","rental_id":243020,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}